/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/deployments","created_at":"2025-04-11T06:17:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-23T15:09:58Z","pushed_at":"2026-08-24T18:45:22Z","git_url":"git://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:startreedata/mcp-pinot.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot","homepage":"","size":1680,"stargazers_count":17,"watchers_count":17,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":11,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":8,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":11,"open_issues":8,"watchers":17,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/pulls/95","html_url":"https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot/pull/95","diff_url":"https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot/pull/95.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot/pull/95.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-25T06:09:53Z"},"body":"## Summary\n- default MCP HTTP binding to loopback instead of all interfaces\n- fail closed when HTTP is bound to a non-loopback host without OAuth enabled\n- enforce parser-backed, single-statement read-only SQL validation in PinotClient with sqlglot before forwarding read-query SQL to Pinot\n- make Helm defaults local-only with no Service, and require OAuth for any non-loopback Kubernetes exposure\n- add SECURITY.md with vulnerability reporting instructions, security categories, and an HTTP exposure checklist\n- remove the stale PR_DESCRIPTION.md helper file; the GitHub PR body is now the canonical change summary\n- update README, user guide, docs site, changelog, env example, and Helm guidance with secure exposure notes and example read-only query behavior\n\n## Root Cause\nIssue #90 and [GHSA-73cv-556c-w3g6](https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot/security/advisories/GHSA-73cv-556c-w3g6) were valid: the server defaulted to unauthenticated HTTP on 0.0.0.0, and read-query only checked that input started with SELECT. That left network exposure too broad by default and made stacked/comment-obfuscated SQL possible before Pinot saw the query.\n\n## User Impact\nBy default, local HTTP now listens on 127.0.0.1. If users intentionally configure MCP_HOST=0.0.0.0, the server now refuses to start unless OAUTH_ENABLED=true. Helm defaults render local-only without a Service; enabling Service/Traefik/HTTP probes requires a non-loopback host, and any non-loopback host requires OAuth. read-query now accepts one valid SELECT or WITH ... SELECT statement, rejects stacked statements and write/DDL/admin keywords, and keeps Pinot trailing OPTION(...) clauses working. SECURITY.md documents vulnerability reporting, security categories, and the checklist for safely exposing HTTP.\n\n## Validation\n- uv lock --check\n- uv run pytest\n- uv run pytest tests/test_pinot_client.py -q\n- uv run ruff check mcp_pinot mcp_pinot_ops tests\n- uv run ruff format --check mcp_pinot mcp_pinot_ops tests\n- helm lint helm/mcp-pinot\n- helm template default renders no Service\n- helm template rejects Service/Traefik/HTTP health checks with loopback host\n- helm template rejects non-loopback host without OAuth\n- helm template renders Service when service.enabled=true, mcp.host=0.0.0.0, and mcp.oauth.enabled=true\n- git diff --check\n\nFixes #90\nAddresses [GHSA-73cv-556c-w3g6](https://github.com/startreedata/mcp-pinot/security/advisories/GHSA-73cv-556c-w3g6)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/issues/95/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/issues/95/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":25914165158,"node_id":"CE_lADOOXti_M8AAAABBN9TEs8AAAAGCJrHpg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/startreedata/mcp-pinot/issues/events/25914165158","actor":{"login":"xiangfu0","id":1202120,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDIxMjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1202120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiangfu0","html_url":"https://github.com/xiangfu0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiangfu0/followers","following_url":"https